<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="git-addon-interface-overview">
  <title>Git Client Interface Overview</title>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>interface overview</indexterm></indexterm>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>views</indexterm></indexterm>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>Git menu</indexterm></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <conbody>
    <p id="p_git_client_interface_overview">The <ph keyref="plugin-git-client"/> adds several Git entry points in <ph keyref="product"/>. Use this overview to quickly find where to work, then follow the task topics for step-by-step guidance or the reference sections for detailed lookup information.</p><p>For detailed descriptions of each interface area, see <xref href="git-addon-interface-reference.dita#git-addon-interface-reference"/>. For detailed descriptions of individual commands, see <xref href="git-addon-actions-reference.dita#git-addon-actions-reference"/>.</p><p><table frame="all" rowsep="1" colsep="1" id="table_kqw_kx4_pjc">
        <title>Git Client workflow areas by location</title>
        <tgroup cols="3">
          <colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" colwidth="1*"/>
          <colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" colwidth="1*"/>
          <colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" colwidth="1*"/>
          <thead>
            <row>
              <entry>Location</entry>
              <entry>Best For</entry>
              <entry>Details</entry>
            </row>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <row>
              <entry><uicontrol
                  conref="git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs0-git-staging-view"/>
                view</entry>
              <entry>Reviewing changes, staging files, committing, pushing, and pulling.</entry>
              <entry><xref href="git-addon-git-staging-view-interface.dita#git-addon-git-staging-view-interface">Git Staging View</xref></entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry><uicontrol>Git Branch Manager</uicontrol> view</entry>
              <entry>Switching branches and working with local and remote branches.</entry>
              <entry><xref href="git-addon-git-branch-manager.dita#git-addon-git-branch-manager">Git Branch Manager View</xref></entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry><uicontrol conref="git-history-view.dita#git-history-view/git-history"/>
                view</entry>
              <entry>Inspecting commits, comparing revisions, and reviewing affected resources.</entry>
              <entry><xref href="git-addon-showing-the-repository-history.dita#git-addon-showing-the-repository-history">Git History View</xref></entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry><uicontrol conref="../add-ons/sa-toolbar-git.dita#sa-toolbar-git/sa-toolbar-git"/>
                menu</entry>
              <entry>Repository-level commands such as clone, open, push, pull, fetch, and settings.</entry>
              <entry><xref href="git-addon-git-menu.dita#git-addon-git-menu">Git Menu</xref></entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry><uicontrol>Project</uicontrol>, <uicontrol>DITA Maps Manager</uicontrol>, and
                  <uicontrol>Editor</uicontrol> views</entry>
              <entry>Contextual Git actions for the selected resource.</entry>
              <entry><xref href="git-actions-in-other-views-editors.dita#git-actions-in-other-views-editors">Git Actions in Other Views and Editors</xref></entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry><uicontrol>Preferences</uicontrol></entry>
              <entry>Configuring Git Client behavior and AI-related settings.</entry>
              <entry><xref href="git-addon-preferences.dita#git-addon-preferences">Preferences</xref></entry>
            </row>
          </tbody>
        </tgroup>
      </table></p>
  </conbody>
</concept>
